t","category":"현장·반응","market":false,"titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"archive-index","resultRisk":true},{"id":"g-3e684590e0f4fa","date":"1998-08-29","source":"https://www.theguardian.com/football/1998/aug/29/newsstory.sport","publisher":"The Guardian","dateBasis":"publisher-daily-archive","title":"Ferdinand: The star pupil","category":"현장·반응","market":false,"titleTranslation":"original","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"archive-index","resultRisk":true},{"id":"g-aa41de0941f9af","date":"1998-08-31","source":"https://www.theguardian.com/football/1998/aug/31/match.sport","publisher":"The Guardian","dateBasis":"publisher-daily-archive","title":"Angell comes down like fire on the 울버햄프턴 원더러스","category":"현장·반응","market":false,"titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"archive-index","resultRisk":true}],"events":[{"id":"h-0b4fef06c19095f4","date":"1998-08-03","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"뉴캐슬 유나이티드 pay £5.25million for Germany midfielder Dietmar Hamann from 바이에른 뮌헨 .","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-295c6e74b9764a46","date":"1998-08-09","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"아스널 claim their third trophy of 1998 with a 3–0 win over 맨체스터 유나이티드 in the Charity Shield .","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-ffcce9291e6fbfa3","date":"1998-08-12","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"뉴캐슬 유나이티드 sign Nolberto Solano , the Peruvian midfielder, from 보카 주니어스 for £2.48million.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-2433f2526c5a2813","date":"1998-08-15","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"The Premier League season begins with champions 아스널 beating newly promoted 노팅엄 포리스트 2–1 at Highbury . 첼시 begin with a surprise 2–1 defeat at 코번트리 시티 . 맨체스터 유나이티드 are held to a 2–2 home draw by 레스터 시티 . 윔블던 take the lead of the Premier League on the opening day with a 3–1 home win over 토트넘 홋스퍼 . 찰턴 애슬레틱 mark their return to the elite by drawing 0–0 at 뉴캐슬 유나이티드.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-cc55eeb84cd8d464","date":"1998-08-16","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998_in_association_football#Events","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"연도별 사건 기록","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"PSV wins the 요한 크라위프 Shield , the annual opening of the new season in the Eredivisie , by a 2–0 win over Ajax in the Amsterdam Arena .","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-69536831339a850f","date":"1998-08-20","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"맨체스터 유나이티드 pay a club record £12.6million for 애스턴 빌라 striker Dwight Yorke .","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-ad7bf1e56a5686e8","date":"1998-08-22","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"찰턴 애슬레틱 demolish 사우샘프턴 5–0 at The Valley . 토트넘 홋스퍼's dismal start continued when they lose 3–0 at home to 셰필드 웬즈데이 . 맨체스터 유나이티드 are held to a draw again, this time 0–0 against 웨스트햄 유나이티드 at Upton Park . 뉴캐슬 유나이티드 lose 4–1 at home to 리버풀.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-fa5f0755c3badf77","date":"1998-08-27","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"케니 달글리시 is sacked after 19 months as manager of 뉴캐슬 유나이티드.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0},{"id":"h-b8f1a965060e0db0","date":"1998-08-31","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1998%E2%80%9399_in_English_football#Diary_of_the_season","publisher":"위키백과 기여자","historyKind":"시즌 일지","dateBasis":"event-date-in-secondary-history","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","title":"뉴캐슬 유나이티드 appoint 뤼트 휠릿 as their new manager, the day before his 36th birthday. The first month of the league season ends with newly promoted 찰턴 애슬레틱 top of the Premier League, but the end-of-month table has little significance as only two games have been played so far. 선덜랜드 head the race for a place in next season's Premier League as Division One leaders, with 울버햄프턴 원더러스 in second place. Hopes are high of a successful season for Midlands clubs as 웨스트브로미치 앨비언 are third and 버밍엄 시티 stand fourth. 노리치 시티 , rebuilding under new manager Bruce Rioch occupy fifth, while the top six is completed by a 왓퍼드 side who are searching for a second successive promotion. Just outside the playoff zone are Bury , whose excellent start to the season has sparked speculation that they might match 스완지 시티 and 윔블던's record of three promotions in four seasons.","titleTranslation":"names","sourceLanguage":"en","kind":"history-record","priority":0}]}